      "name": "Plant Experimental Conditions Ontology (PECO)",
      "description": "An ontology (OBO/OWL) that models plant experimental conditions and exposures — classes for exposures (e.g. 'nickel exposure', 'glucose exposure'), stimulus terms linked to ChEBI/ENVO/NCBITaxon, pattern-driven term generation (exposure-chebi, exposure-ncbitaxon, exposure-chebi_role), released via PURLs (peco.owl / peco.obo) and edited in Protege."
